{"c":[{"id":"0077b084d2383d9f","sum":"Keys and builds: vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file (CoreLaunchSettings envFile holds AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY/GROQ_API_KEY as KEY=value); make install needs the packages/keytype checkout or xcodebuild resolve exits 74.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T214418Z-9e6967d283b5b427","text":"vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file (not KEY=value); CoreLaunchSettings envFile is the KV path for AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY / GROQ_API_KEY.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T214943Z-7cb27000d0b12580","text":"make install requires packages/keytype checkout (CompletionUI); empty submodule dir makes xcodebuild resolve fail with 74","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f8e28d7f83c0c10b","sum":"v1 gateway skills: Debug last-N skips the Caret Debug window, inference last_n_windows does not; Translate reads a live selection or the clipboard, never the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T215111Z-04557dfeed12d63f","text":"Debug last-N windows skip title Caret Debug (matches showDebugWindow); inference last_n_windows does not skip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T215901Z-031ebbfd04136a32","text":"Translate uses a live non-empty selection or the clipboard; it never uses the caret line. Other gateway skills still do.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
